---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services & Upcoming Trips
description: Two ways to plan a trip with Milena. Join one of her upcoming trips, or have a custom trip designed just for you.
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import tripCard with context -%}

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Services &amp; Upcoming Trips</h1>
    <p class="lead">Two ways to plan a trip with me: join one of my upcoming trips, or have one designed just for you.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card service-card">
        <p class="h3">Upcoming Trips</p>
        <p>Trips I've designed, and I come along on every one. Pick one, save your spot, and I'll take care of the rest.</p>
        <p class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#upcoming-trips">See upcoming trips</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card service-card">
        <p class="h3">Custom Trip Planner</p>
        <p>Have somewhere in mind? Tell me where and who's coming, and I'll design the trip and send you a quote.</p>
        {%- if site.draft %}
        <p>{% ph "Is the quote free, or is there a planning fee?" %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#custom-trip">Plan a custom trip</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if site.draft %}
<section class="section section-lagoon" aria-labelledby="included-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="measure">
      <h2 id="included-heading">What “everything” includes</h2>
      <p>When I say I take care of everything, here's what that usually means:</p>
      <p>{% ph "What's usually included: flights? hotels? transfers? tickets? meals?" %}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section section-white" id="upcoming-trips" aria-labelledby="trips-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="trips-heading">Upcoming Trips</h2>
      <p class="lead">Where are we going next? {% if collections.upcomingTrips.length %}Here's what's coming up.{% else %}The next trip is in the works.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {%- for trip in collections.upcomingTrips %}
      {{ tripCard(trip) }}
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- if not collections.upcomingTrips.length %}
      <div class="card more-card">
        <h3>More trips are on the way</h3>
        <p>I'm always planning the next one. Want to hear about it first? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> and I'll let you know.</p>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="card more-card">
        <h3>Don't see what you want?</h3>
        <p>I'll design a trip just for you. <a href="#custom-trip">Plan a custom trip</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="custom-trip" aria-labelledby="custom-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="custom-heading">Custom Trip Planner</h2>
      <p class="lead">Tell me about the trip you've been dreaming of. I'll design it around your pace and budget, then send you a quote.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps grid grid-3">
      <li>
        <h3>Tell me your idea</h3>
        <p>Where you'd like to go, when, and who's coming. "Not sure yet" is a fine answer.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>I design it and send a quote</h3>
        <p>I'll put together a trip that fits you, and send you a quote with all the details.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Get ready to go</h3>
        <p>Then just bring your passport.{% if site.draft %} {% ph "Does Milena come along on custom trips too?" %}{% endif %}</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="card form-card">
      <h3>Tell me about your dream trip</h3>
      {% include "partials/custom-trip-form.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
